                 example: "Es importante dormir bien · Es importante que duermas bien"),
        MoodNode(id: "subject.doer", level: 4, parent: "subject.feel", title: "Me gusta bailar: who does it",
                 rule: "With gustar, encantar, importar, the one who feels is me, te, le… If that person also does the action: infinitive (me gusta bailar). Someone else: que + subjunctive (me gusta que bailes).",
