        MoodNode(id: "subject.overlap", level: 4, parent: "want.same", title: "Quiero que vayamos: I and we",
                 rule: "Being part of the group doesn't make yo and nosotros the same person, and it never allows the indicative: quiero que vayamos juntos. But queremos que vayamos is wrong (we = we): queremos ir. An infinitive is fine when nothing in it says 'we': me alegro de haber ganado, said by a team member. Quiero ir juntos is heard but not standard. Quiero que me operen, espero que me vaya bien: the subject is someone or something else, so que is needed.",
